{"version":1,"content":"<p>近來，遊戲反編譯領域的生態徹底被顛覆。玩家藉助AI就能粗略完成編碼，輕鬆拆解遊戲的二進制文件並轉換為C++代碼，將主機獨佔遊戲移植到Windows和Linux平台。近期這類移植大作層出不窮，《超級馬裏奧銀河》《王國之心 358/2天》都已有粉絲製作的PC移植版。技術發展到如今，《極品飛車：地下狂飆2》《光環：戰鬥進化》這類老遊戲甚至能直接在網頁瀏覽器中運行。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586392.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.142220+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"2d458763892d08dc25b13cffed8f2130a14cedefa25ed832c1761f5d8e6a0e3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}